  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">F&#xf6;rberedelser adminreform</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Preparations adminreform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sveriges engagemang inom omr&#xe5;det administrativ reform/lokalt sj&#xe4;lvstyre &#xe4;r m&#xe5;ng&#xe5;rigt.Tanken med denna f&#xf6;rberedande insats &#xe4;r att se hur de tidigare erfarenheterna b&#xe4;st kan tas till vara nu n&#xe4;r den nya regereringen &#xe5;terupptar reformarbetet. Uppdraget &#xe4;r f&#xf6;rst att fungera som en bollplank n&#xe4;r konkretiseringen av reformen p&#xe5;b&#xf6;rjas med diskussioner med Ministerns kansli samt med en arbetsgrupp.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden&#xb4;s engagement within the area of administrative reform/local self governance goes back several years. The aim of this preparatory activity is to see how the earlier experiences could best be fed into the reform work that the new government has started. The task is to function as a discussion partner for the Minister and for the Working Group under him that has started to concretize the reform.</narrative>
  </description>
